<% content_for :title, "Keyboard Shortcuts" %>

<div class="max-w-lg mx-auto space-y-8 py-4">

  <h1 class="text-3xl font-heading font-bold text-center">Keyboard Shortcuts</h1>

  <div class="space-y-1 text-text-secondary text-sm">
    <div class="flex justify-between py-1 border-b border-dotted border-border-primary">
      <span>Open list switcher</span>
      <kbd class="font-mono text-xs px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-surface-secondary text-text-primary">P</kbd>
    </div>
    <div class="flex justify-between py-1 border-b border-dotted border-border-primary">
      <span>Switch to Inbox tab</span>
      <kbd class="font-mono text-xs px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-surface-secondary text-text-primary">1</kbd>
    </div>
    <div class="flex justify-between py-1 border-b border-dotted border-border-primary">
      <span>Switch to Focus tab</span>
      <kbd class="font-mono text-xs px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-surface-secondary text-text-primary">2</kbd>
    </div>
    <div class="flex justify-between py-1 border-b border-dotted border-border-primary">
      <span>Switch to Completed tab</span>
      <kbd class="font-mono text-xs px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-surface-secondary text-text-primary">3</kbd>
    </div>
    <div class="flex justify-between py-1 border-b border-dotted border-border-primary">
      <span>Switch to Snoozed tab</span>
      <kbd class="font-mono text-xs px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-surface-secondary text-text-primary">4</kbd>
    </div>
    <div class="flex justify-between py-1 border-b border-dotted border-border-primary">
      <span>Navigate tasks</span>
      <span>
        <kbd class="font-mono text-xs px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-surface-secondary text-text-primary">&uarr;</kbd>
        <kbd class="font-mono text-xs px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-surface-secondary text-text-primary">&darr;</kbd>
      </span>
    </div>
    <div class="flex justify-between py-1 border-b border-dotted border-border-primary">
      <span>Complete/uncomplete selected task</span>
      <kbd class="font-mono text-xs px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-surface-secondary text-text-primary">Enter</kbd>
    </div>
    <div class="flex justify-between py-1 border-b border-dotted border-border-primary">
      <span>Focus task input</span>
      <kbd class="font-mono text-xs px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-surface-secondary text-text-primary">/</kbd>
    </div>
    <div class="flex justify-between py-1">
      <span>Go back / close menu</span>
      <kbd class="font-mono text-xs px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-surface-secondary text-text-primary">Esc</kbd>
    </div>
  </div>

  <h2 class="text-xl font-heading font-bold text-center">Quick Add</h2>

  <div class="space-y-2 text-text-secondary text-sm">
    <p class="m-0">
      Add <code class="font-mono text-xs px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded bg-surface-secondary text-text-primary">#category</code>
      anywhere in a new task to file it under that category, e.g.
      <code class="font-mono text-xs px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded bg-surface-secondary text-text-primary">Buy milk #home</code>.
    </p>
    <p class="m-0 text-text-tertiary">
      Case, spaces and dashes don't matter, so <code class="font-mono text-xs">#sideproject</code> matches "Side project".
      Tags that don't match a category are left in the task name.
    </p>
    <p class="m-0 pt-2">
      End a new task with how often it repeats to make it recurring, e.g.
      <code class="font-mono text-xs px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded bg-surface-secondary text-text-primary">Get milk every monday</code>.
    </p>
    <ul class="m-0 pl-5 text-text-tertiary space-y-0.5">
      <li><code class="font-mono text-xs">every day</code>, <code class="font-mono text-xs">daily</code>, <code class="font-mono text-xs">every other day</code></li>
      <li><code class="font-mono text-xs">every weekday</code> (Monday to Friday)</li>
      <li><code class="font-mono text-xs">every monday</code> (or <code class="font-mono text-xs">mon</code>), <code class="font-mono text-xs">every other monday</code>, <code class="font-mono text-xs">every week</code>, <code class="font-mono text-xs">every other week</code>, <code class="font-mono text-xs">fortnightly</code></li>
      <li><code class="font-mono text-xs">every month on the 1st</code>, <code class="font-mono text-xs">every 1st</code>, <code class="font-mono text-xs">monthly</code></li>
      <li><code class="font-mono text-xs">every March 15</code>, <code class="font-mono text-xs">every 15th March</code>, <code class="font-mono text-xs">yearly</code></li>
    </ul>
    <p class="m-0 text-text-tertiary">
      If today isn't one of its days, the task is snoozed until the first one. It works alongside
      <code class="font-mono text-xs">#category</code> in either order. To skip one occurrence without
      ending the series, open the task and choose <strong>Skip this time</strong>.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="flex items-center justify-center">
    <%= link_to "Back", root_path, class: "text-sm text-text-tertiary hover:text-text-secondary no-underline" %>
  </div>

</div>
